[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m saturation constant, the two's-complement index, the shift whose count leaves
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the standard-defined range, and the IEEE-754 special values. Each row below is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m one distinct such condition, taken from what the source actually does, and each
